01:37:11.970 --> 01:37:18.310
Sen. Francis "Chiz" G. Escudero: may counsel. So you're admitting that it's not notarized? Even your premarked copy is not notarized, whether we use that copy or this one?

01:37:18.470 --> 01:37:19.670
Rep. Gerville “Jinky Bitrics” R. Luistro: We admit to that, Your Honor.

01:37:19.970 --> 01:37:28.950
Sen. Francis "Chiz" G. Escudero: The witness will please explain why he is using in his investigation a document and or affidavit that is not...

01:37:31.580 --> 01:37:37.700
