01:37:38.840 --> 01:38:00.700
Atty. Melvin Matibag: Alam niyo po, Your Honor, sa law enforcement po meron po tayo mga tinatawag na open source intel. At ito po ay pinadala sa atin at ating pong susundahan. At kaya nga po ang aming pong investigasyon ay isang continuing investigation, open, continuing, and active investigation. Sa pagka dito bang ganitong dokumento ay amin ding ikukumpara pa.

01:38:07.880 --> 01:38:13.220
Sen. Francis "Chiz" G. Escudero: So for the

01:38:13.220 --> 01:38:45.830
Sen. Francis "Chiz" G. Escudero: second time and for the sake of clarity and then for the information and guidance of the senator judges, the document being identified by the witness is unsigned, is not notarized, not under oath. It is only as to the fact that they used this document in their investigation or as part of their investigation but not as to the truth of the allegations contained in that unsubscribed document that was not made under oath.

01:38:52.700 --> 01:38:54.480
Atty. Mark C. Vinluan: It doesn't qualify as a signature. With

01:38:54.480 --> 01:39:01.520
Sen. Francis "Chiz" G. Escudero: the additional manifestation of the respondent, so noted, what is the manifestation of the council for the prosecutors?

01:39:02.120 --> 01:39:23.570
Rep. Gerville “Jinky Bitrics” R. Luistro: Your Honor, based on the ICC, as relayed to us by our witness in the next article or in the last article that we will present, the ICC does not require Notarization of Document Noted,

01:39:24.020 --> 01:39:40.800
Sen. Francis "Chiz" G. Escudero: but we are not the ICC Council. Again, we're just placing on the record and for the record the factual situation concerning the document that the witness is testifying to for the information and guidance of the Senator-Judges. Counsel for the panel of prosecutors, you may proceed.

01:39:41.630 --> 01:39:54.350
Rep. Gerville “Jinky Bitrics” R. Luistro: Mr. Witness, for purposes of sub-marking, can you read just a portion of paragraph 270? Just for the guidance of the impeachment court.

01:39:54.610 --> 01:40:01.750
Atty. Mark C. Vinluan: Again, Your Honor, same objection. The document will speak for itself. Best evidence of this statement is the document.

01:40:01.770 --> 01:40:03.550
